§§ `Section 15.2 -- the salary and wages on which a second additional contribution has been made`

-- src:470 | Amount of salary and wages on which second additional contribution made
-- src:471 | 15.2 (1) The amount of a person’s salary and wages on which a second additional contribution has been made for a year is an amount equal to the product obtained when the ratio referred to in subsection 8(8) is multiplied by the following amount, divided by the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year:
-- src:472 | (a) the aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of that person on account of the employee’s second additional contribution for the year under this Act or under a provincial pension plan and the amounts determined under clauses 15(1)(b)(ii)(B) and 15.1(1)(b)(ii)(B),
-- src:473 | minus
-- src:474 | (b) the amount determined under subsection 8(2).
-- "The amount determined under subsection 8(2)" is read as the excess amount calculated in accordance with 8(2) (NOTES.md, fork register).
@ref Act s 15.2(1) (src:471-474)
GIVEN `the ratio referred to in subsection 8(8)` IS A NUMBER
      `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of that person on account of the employee's second additional contribution for the year under this Act or under a provincial pension plan` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount determined under clause 15(1)(b)(ii)(B)` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount determined under clause 15.1(1)(b)(ii)(B)` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount determined under subsection 8(2)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 15.2(1) — the amount of a person's salary and wages on which a second additional contribution has been made for a year`
        `the ratio referred to in subsection 8(8)`
        `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year`
        `the aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of that person on account of the employee's second additional contribution for the year under this Act or under a provincial pension plan`
        `the amount determined under clause 15(1)(b)(ii)(B)`
        `the amount determined under clause 15.1(1)(b)(ii)(B)`
        `the amount determined under subsection 8(2)`
    MEANS
        IF `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year` EQUALS 0
        THEN NOTHING
        ELSE JUST (`the ratio referred to in subsection 8(8)` TIMES (`paragraph (a)` MINUS `paragraph (b)`) DIVIDED BY `the second additional contribution rate for employees for the year`)
    WHERE
        -- (a) the aggregate deducted for the second additional contribution under this Act or a provincial plan, and the amounts determined under clauses 15(1)(b)(ii)(B) and 15.1(1)(b)(ii)(B)
        `paragraph (a)` MEANS
            `the aggregate of all amounts deducted as required from the remuneration of that person on account of the employee's second additional contribution for the year under this Act or under a provincial pension plan`
            PLUS `the amount determined under clause 15(1)(b)(ii)(B)`
            PLUS `the amount determined under clause 15.1(1)(b)(ii)(B)`
        -- (b) the amount determined under subsection 8(2)
        `paragraph (b)` MEANS `the amount determined under subsection 8(2)`

