§§ `Section 15.3 -- the special rule in prescribed circumstances`

-- src:479 | Special rule applicable in prescribed circumstances
-- src:480 | 15.3 If an employer has filed a return in accordance with this Part showing an amount as the salary and wages on which contributions have been made by an employee for a year under this Act, the amount so shown, multiplied by the contribution rate, the first additional contribution rate or the second additional contribution rate, as the case may be, for employees for the year, may, in prescribed circumstances, be substituted for the amount shown in the return as the aggregate of the amounts deducted by that employer on account of the employee’s contributions for the year under this Act, in calculating the amount to be determined under subsection 15(1), 15.1(1) or 15.2(1).
-- "may, in prescribed circumstances, be substituted": the amount that may be substituted for the aggregate shown in the return.
@ref Act s 15.3 (src:479-480)
GIVEN `the employer has filed a return in accordance with this Part showing an amount as the salary and wages on which contributions have been made by an employee for a year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amount so shown` IS A NUMBER
      `the contribution rate, the first additional contribution rate or the second additional contribution rate, as the case may be, for employees for the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the circumstances are prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 15.3 — the amount that may be substituted for the aggregate of the amounts deducted by the employer` `the employer has filed a return in accordance with this Part showing an amount as the salary and wages on which contributions have been made by an employee for a year` `the amount so shown` `the contribution rate, the first additional contribution rate or the second additional contribution rate, as the case may be, for employees for the year` `the circumstances are prescribed` MEANS
    IF `the employer has filed a return in accordance with this Part showing an amount as the salary and wages on which contributions have been made by an employee for a year` AND `the circumstances are prescribed`
    THEN JUST (`the amount so shown` TIMES `the contribution rate, the first additional contribution rate or the second additional contribution rate, as the case may be, for employees for the year`)
    ELSE NOTHING
